Leprechaun Halls are a fairly recent addition, probably making their
entrance around 3.2 or 3.3.  Amber may have inspired their introduction
in some way, but they should not be considered to be "from" that
series: there are also cockatrice nests, antholes, throne rooms,
barracks, David's Treasure Zoos, and beehives.

The ultimate inspiration for of these rooms is probably the zoos/party
rooms from Rogue, although not even the cockatrice nest is as dangerous
as those tend to be.

